# Database initialization

Alembic manages the database schema for the Personal Knowledge Hub backend.

From the `backend` directory, activate the virtual environment and apply all
migrations:

```powershell
.\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
alembic upgrade head
```

The default SQLite database is created at:

```text
backend/personal_knowledge_hub.db
```

To inspect the current migration version:

```powershell
alembic current
```

To create a migration after changing SQLAlchemy models:

```powershell
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"
```
